  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7901.05 Missing Person Report Criteria",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7901.05 Missing Person Report Criteria. A missing person report shall be filed by a local law enforcement agency within 48 hours of receiving notice of a missing person who meets the definition of a missing adult.\n\nSource. #14199, eff 2-25-25",
